      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-10T21:01:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, assuming that you actually need a virtual \u0027init\u0027 method (see my comment on it below), you indeed need to declare a virtual destructor. In this case, prefer to use `\u003d default` instead of `{}`, see go/totw/131.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 41,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 41,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "b62cf4a993454ca0e4d6f6e710ed0ad7762a7446",
